<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Sirius — a control layer for AI agents that can move money</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Sirius decides, per action, whether an autonomous agent's transaction should happen — and keeps a signed record of every decision, including the ones it allowed. Runs entirely on your machine."
    />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-void: #0a0b10;
        --bg-surface: #12141c;
        --bg-raised: #1a1d28;
        --bg-grid: #14161f;
        --border-hairline: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        --emerald: #4ade80;
        --teal: #2dd4bf;
        --cyan: #38bdf8;
        --indigo: #818cf8;
        --violet: #a78bfa;
        --text-hi: #f3f4f8;
        --text-md: #b7bbc9;
        --text-lo: #767b8c;
        --font-display: "Inter", -apple-system, sans-serif;
        --font-body: "Inter", -apple-system, sans-serif;
        --font-code: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--bg-void);
        color: var(--text-hi);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      ::selection {
        background: var(--cyan);
        color: var(--bg-void);
      }

      #webgl {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        z-index: 0;
        display: block;
      }
      #grain {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 1;
        pointer-events: none;
        opacity: 0.05;
        mix-blend-mode: overlay;
        background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='2' stitchTiles='stitch'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
      }
      #vignette {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 1;
        pointer-events: none;
        background: radial-gradient(
          ellipse at center,
          rgba(10, 11, 16, 0) 40%,
          rgba(10, 11, 16, 0.75) 100%
        );
      }
      .no-webgl #webgl,
      .no-webgl #grain {
        display: none;
      }
      .no-webgl body {
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #161a26 0%, #0a0b10 65%);
      }

      nav {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        z-index: 10;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      nav .word {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--text-hi);
        pointer-events: auto;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      nav .links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.6rem;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }
      nav .links a {
        color: var(--text-md);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.03em;
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }
      nav .links a:hover {
        color: var(--cyan);
      }
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        nav .links {
          display: none;
        }
      }

      main {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }
      section.panel {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 8vh 6vw;
        position: relative;
      }
      section.panel.center {
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .content {
        max-width: 640px;
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(28px);
        transition:
          opacity 0.9s ease,
          transform 0.9s ease;
      }
      .content.wide {
        max-width: 820px;
      }
      .panel.is-visible .content {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      .eyebrow {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.22em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--cyan);
        margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      h1,
      h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.08;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--text-hi);
        margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5.6vw, 4.2rem);
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.6vw, 2.7rem);
      }
      p.lede {
        font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
        color: var(--text-md);
        line-height: 1.65;
        margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
      }
      p.body {
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        color: var(--text-md);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
      }
      strong {
        color: var(--text-hi);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .glass {
        background: rgba(18, 20, 28, 0.62);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
        border-radius: 16px;
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
      }

      .btn {
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        background: var(--bg-raised);
        color: var(--text-hi);
        transition:
          border-color 0.2s,
          box-shadow 0.2s,
          transform 0.15s;
      }
      .btn:hover {
        border-color: var(--cyan);
        box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }
      .btn.primary {
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18),
          rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.18)
        );
        border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
      }
      .btn.ghost {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--text-md);
        border-color: transparent;
      }
      .btn.ghost:hover {
        color: var(--cyan);
        box-shadow: none;
        border-color: transparent;
        transform: none;
      }
      .btn:disabled {
        opacity: 0.5;
        cursor: default;
      }
      .btn-row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.9rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
      }

      .micro {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--text-lo);
        margin-top: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        max-width: 420px;
      }

      /* HERO */
      #hero {
        padding-top: 0;
      }
      #hero .content {
        max-width: 720px;
      }
      .hero-mark {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
      }
      .hero-mark .dot {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--emerald);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--emerald);
      }
      .hero-mark span {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        color: var(--text-lo);
      }
      .scroll-cue {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 2.4rem;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        color: var(--text-lo);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        animation: bob 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
        opacity: 0;
      }
      #hero.is-visible .scroll-cue {
        opacity: 1;
        transition: opacity 1s ease 1.2s;
      }
      @keyframes bob {
        0%,
        100% {
          transform: translate(-50%, 0);
        }
        50% {
          transform: translate(-50%, 8px);
        }
      }
      .chev {
        width: 14px;
        height: 14px;
        border-right: 1.5px solid var(--text-lo);
        border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--text-lo);
        transform: rotate(45deg);
      }

      /* STAGE CARDS */
      .stage-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 0.9rem;
        margin-top: 1.6rem;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 820px;
      }
      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .stage-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
      }
      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .stage-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
      .stage-card {
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 1.1rem 1.15rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
        background: rgba(18, 20, 28, 0.55);
        transition:
          border-color 0.25s,
          transform 0.2s;
        min-height: 118px;
      }
      .stage-card:hover,
      .stage-card.revealed {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        border-color: var(--stage-c, var(--cyan));
      }
      .stage-card .num {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        color: var(--stage-c, var(--cyan));
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      }
      .stage-card h3 {
        margin: 0.35rem 0 0.4rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text-hi);
        text-transform: capitalize;
      }
      .stage-card .q {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: var(--text-md);
        line-height: 1.45;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .stage-card .ex {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        color: var(--stage-c, var(--cyan));
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin-top: 0.6rem;
        padding-top: 0.6rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
        opacity: 0;
        max-height: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
      }
      .stage-card:hover .ex,
      .stage-card.revealed .ex {
        opacity: 1;
        max-height: 200px;
      }

      /* CONSOLE / TERMINAL BLOCKS */
      .term {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        background: var(--bg-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 780px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        white-space: pre;
        color: var(--text-md);
      }
      .term .l-block {
        color: var(--violet);
      }
      .term .l-constrain {
        color: var(--indigo);
      }
      .term .l-verify {
        color: var(--cyan);
      }
      .term .l-allow {
        color: var(--emerald);
      }
      .term .l-fail {
        color: var(--violet);
      }
      .term .l-ok {
        color: var(--emerald);
      }
      .feed-line {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        animation: feedIn 0.5s ease forwards;
      }
      @keyframes feedIn {
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      .num-tabular {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      /* CAP BAR SECTION */
      .caseline {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text-md);
        border-left: 2px solid var(--violet);
        padding-left: 1rem;
        margin-top: 1.2rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      /* TRAIL SECTION */
      .trail-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 1.2rem;
      }
      #trailStatus {
        margin-top: 1rem;
        min-height: 2.4em;
      }

      /* SCAN SECTION */
      .code-card {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        background: var(--bg-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 780px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--text-md);
        overflow-x: auto;
      }
      .code-card .sev {
        color: var(--violet);
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .code-card .loc {
        color: var(--text-lo);
      }
      .code-card .flag {
        color: var(--indigo);
      }
      .scan-summary {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, auto);
        gap: 1.6rem;
        margin-top: 1.4rem;
        font-family: var(--font-code);
      }
      .scan-summary div span {
        display: block;
      }
      .scan-summary .v {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        color: var(--violet);
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .scan-summary .k {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--text-lo);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        margin-top: 0.2rem;
      }

      /* STATS */
      .stat-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 1.2rem;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 900px;
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }
      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .stat-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
      }
      .stat-tile {
        padding: 1.4rem 1.2rem;
        border-radius: 14px;
      }
      .stat-tile .v {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 2.1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--cyan);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .stat-tile .l {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--text-md);
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
      }

      /* CTA */
      .cmd-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.7rem;
        background: var(--bg-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 620px;
      }
      .cmd-row code {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: var(--emerald);
        flex: 1;
        overflow-x: auto;
        white-space: pre;
      }
      .copy-btn {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--text-md);
        background: transparent;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        transition:
          color 0.2s,
          border-color 0.2s;
      }
      .copy-btn:hover {
        color: var(--cyan);
        border-color: var(--cyan);
      }

      footer {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 4rem 2rem 3rem;
        color: var(--text-lo);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }
      footer .word {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        color: var(--text-md);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        display: block;
      }

      /* WEBCAM CONSENT OVERLAY */
      #consent {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 20;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        background: rgba(10, 11, 16, 0.72);
        backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
        transition: opacity 0.6s ease;
      }
      #consent.hidden {
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      #consent .box {
        max-width: 460px;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2.2rem 2rem;
      }
      #consent h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
      }
      #consent p {
        color: var(--text-md);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
      }
      #calibrating {
        margin-top: 1rem;
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--teal);
        display: none;
      }
      canvas#sampleCanvas {
        display: none;
      }
      video#srcVideo {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 1px;
        height: 1px;
        opacity: 0.01;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: -1;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <video id="srcVideo" autoplay muted playsinline></video>
    <canvas id="sampleCanvas" width="100" height="50"></canvas>
    <canvas id="webgl"></canvas>
    <div id="grain"></div>
    <div id="vignette"></div>

    <div id="consent">
      <div class="box glass">
        <h2>Before we begin</h2>
        <p>
          Sirius watches every action an agent takes and decides whether it
          should happen. This page can watch <em>you</em>, the same way —
          turning your camera into the particle field below. Nothing is
          uploaded; it never leaves this tab.
        </p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content: center">
          <button class="btn primary" id="grantBtn">
            Begin — grant camera access
          </button>
          <button class="btn ghost" id="skipBtn">
            Skip, use a generated visualization
          </button>
        </div>
        <div id="calibrating">calibrating background… hold still</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <nav>
      <a class="word" href="#hero">SIRIUS</a>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
        <a href="#stages">Stages</a>
        <a href="#trail">Trail</a>
        <a href="#scan">Scan</a>
        <a href="#cta">Install</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <main>
      <section class="panel center" id="hero" data-idx="0">
        <div class="content">
          <div class="hero-mark">
            <span class="dot"></span
            ><span>LOCAL-FIRST · NO BACKEND · NO NETWORK</span>
          </div>
          <h1>An agent with a wallet<br />is a new kind of actor.</h1>
          <p class="lede">
            It holds credentials, decides for itself, and signs its own
            transactions. Every one of those transactions can be perfectly valid
            — and still be the wrong thing to do.
          </p>
          <p class="micro">
            Sirius decides, per action, whether it should happen — and keeps a
            signed record of every decision, including the ones it allowed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll-cue">
          <span>SCROLL</span><span class="chev"></span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" id="problem" data-idx="1">
        <div class="content glass">
          <p class="eyebrow">The problem</p>
          <h2>Technical validity is not<br />behavioural legitimacy.</h2>
          <p class="body">
            A transaction can be correctly signed, properly authenticated,
            inside the agent's own credentials — and still be a transfer it has
            never made before, to a counterparty it has never used, because a
            web page it was reading told it to.
          </p>
          <p class="body">
            Require human approval for every action and the agent isn't
            autonomous — the operator has become the agent. Grant it
            unrestricted authority and a single compromised instruction drains
            the account.
          </p>
          <p class="body">
            <strong>So the answer has to be graduated.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" id="stages" data-idx="2">
        <div class="content wide">
          <p class="eyebrow">Six questions, asked of every action</p>
          <h2>Nothing decides alone.</h2>
          <p class="lede">
            Each stage raises signals, and the verdict is the strongest one —
            because the same fact means different things in combination. A
            first-time counterparty is routine. A large amount is routine. A
            large amount to a first-time counterparty, on an instruction fetched
            from a web page, is not.
          </p>
          <div class="stage-grid" id="stageGrid"></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" id="feed" data-idx="3">
        <div class="content wide">
          <p class="eyebrow">The decision trail</p>
          <h2>264 allowed. 11 blocked.<br />All of them logged.</h2>
          <p class="lede">
            Every action an agent proposes runs the same six checks. Watch a
            batch of 278 get judged.
          </p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <button class="btn primary" id="runFeed">Run 278 actions</button>
          </div>
          <div
            class="term"
            id="feedOutput"
            style="margin-top: 1.2rem; min-height: 9.5em"
          ></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" id="cap" data-idx="4">
        <div class="content">
          <p class="eyebrow">The attacker who read the policy</p>
          <h2>Right under the cap<br />is exactly where they aim.</h2>
          <p class="body">
            A cap stops an action that exceeds it — and says nothing about one
            that lands at 99% of it. At ₹49,500 against a ₹50,000 cap, there is
            no limit breach and only 2σ on amount. Neither signal blocks alone.
          </p>
          <div class="caseline">
            ! BLOCK wlt-9f2c41 ₹49,500 — an amount sized just under the cap, to
            a counterparty never used before. The limit was not breached because
            it was measured first.
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" id="trail" data-idx="5">
        <div class="content wide">
          <p class="eyebrow">The decisions are the product</p>
          <h2>Including the ones<br />it allowed.</h2>
          <p class="lede">
            A control layer's decisions are worth nothing if they can't be shown
            to be the decisions it actually made. Every decision — allowed or
            not — is hash-chained, and the sealed trail is ed25519-signed.
          </p>
          <div class="trail-actions">
            <button class="btn" id="verifyBtn">
              sirius guard trail --verify
            </button>
            <button class="btn ghost" id="tamperBtn">
